<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, Jamaica 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>final day of the first test between West Indies and India at</p>
<p>Sabina Park on Monday:</p>
<p>West Indies first innings 427 (C.Hooper 129, B.Lara 83,</p>
<p>S.Chanderpaul 52, A.Kumble 5-120)</p>
<p>India first innings 346 (N.Mongia 78, V.Laxman 64, F.Rose</p>
<p>6-100)</p>
<p>West Indies second innings (overnight 241-4) S.Campbell b</p>
<p>Kumble 43</p>
<p> S.Williams b Kumble			  26</p>
<p> S.Chanderpaul c Tendulkar b Kuruvilla  48</p>
<p> B.Lara c Mongia b Kumble		   78</p>
<p> C.Hooper not out			     12</p>
<p> R.Holder not out			     21</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 lb-9)			    13</p>
<p> Total (for four wickets declared)     241</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-68 2-81 3-203 4-203</p>
<p>Bowling: Prasad 15-2-46-0, Kuruvilla 17-2-61-1, Kumble</p>
<p>23-6-76-3, Joshi 6-1-27-0, Laxman 3-0-9-0, Tendulkar 2-0-9-0.</p>
</text>
